/T (Biped Locomotion: Design and experimentation of optimal energy efficient biped robots with compliance at foot, knee joints, etc. Exoskeleton: Human motion based design and development of a three finger 10 DOF exoskeleton robot hand for rehabilitation of stroke patients. Intelligent control systems: Design, development and path planning of 14 DOF Lunar rover on 3D terrain. Kinematics and redundancy resolution for performing tasks with arm on rover. Micro Sensors and Actuators: Ionic Polymer Metal Composite \(IPMC\) based grippers and mechanisms for robotic micro assembly. Smart compliant mechanisms)
